/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (2. Young People Who Know Little About Batik The younger generation often lacks understanding and knowledge about batik for several reasons:    - Lack of Education: School curriculums do not emphasize the importance of cultural heritage, including batik. Education about batik is often not in-depth or engaging for young people.    - Influence of Globalization: The influence of pop culture and international fashion trends often attracts young people's attention more than local cultural heritage like batik.    - Stereotypes About Batik: Batik is sometimes considered formal or "old-fashioned" attire, making it less appealing to young people who tend to seek more modern and casual styles.)
